<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{or page.attributes.lang 'en'}}">
  <head>
{{> head}}
  </head>
  <body class="home">
{{> header}}
    <main class="home-main">

      <section class="hero">
        <p class="page-ref">ref crcf</p>
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Alpha · single-user · runs on DGX Spark and NVIDIA GPUs</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Get a model, fine-tune, build, serve.<br><span class="accent">On hardware you own.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Thinkube installs on machines you own. It gives you Python environments
          that build on aarch64, models that are stored once and served, and a path from a notebook
          to something with an address. Certified Kubernetes underneath; you don't have to learn it.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="../install/overview.html">Get started</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="start-here/what-is-thinkube.html">What is Thinkube?</a>
        </div>

        <ol class="loop" aria-label="The Thinkube AI loop">
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="loop-num">1</span><span class="loop-label">Get models</span></li>
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="loop-num">2</span><span class="loop-label">Fine-tune</span></li>
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="loop-num">3</span><span class="loop-label">Build apps</span></li>
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="loop-num">4</span><span class="loop-label">Serve</span></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="cockpit">
        <div class="cockpit-copy">
          <span class="kicker">The cockpit</span>
          <h2 class="section-h">You operate it by talking to Claude</h2>
          <p class="cockpit-lead">You work in code-server with Claude Code. Thinkube's control plane is
            exposed to it as <strong>MCP tools</strong> — deploys, models, GPUs, services, logs. What
            the tools read, Claude can read; what they change, it changes only when you ask. Everything
            here is also a click in thinkube-control.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="codewin" role="img"
             aria-label="A Claude Code session: deploy a template and load a model, driven by MCP tools.">
          <div class="codewin-bar">
            <span class="codewin-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="codewin-title">code-server — claude</span>
          </div>
<pre class="codewin-body" aria-hidden="true"><code><span class="c-prompt">›</span> <span class="c-user">deploy the vLLM template and load Qwen3.5-4B</span>

<span class="c-claude">●</span> Deploying tkt-vllm-gradio.
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">deploy_template</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>tkt-vllm-gradio<span class="c-paren">)</span>       <span class="c-dim">→ pending</span>
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">get_deployment_status</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>…<span class="c-paren">)</span>              <span class="c-dim">→ building → running</span>

<span class="c-claude">●</span> Loading the model.
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">load_llm_model</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B<span class="c-paren">)</span>         <span class="c-dim">→ loading · backend: vllm</span>
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">get_llm_model_status</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>…<span class="c-paren">)</span>               <span class="c-dim">→ available</span>

  Your app is at <span class="c-link">vllm-gradio.thinkube.com</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="journeys">
        <h2 class="section-h">Where to next</h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <a class="card" href="../install/overview.html">
            <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="18" height="6" rx="1"/><line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7" y2="7"/><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="7" y2="17"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="card-kicker">Set up</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Get Thinkube running</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">What you need, what the installer does to your machine, and how long it takes.</p>
            <span class="card-arrow">Set up <em>→</em></span>
          </a>
          <a class="card" href="how-you-work/index.html">
            <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="1.5"/><polyline points="7 9 10 12 7 15"/><line x1="13" y1="15" x2="17" y2="15"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="card-kicker">How you work</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">code-server + Claude</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">Drive the platform from your editor with MCP tools — what Claude Code can read, and what it can change.</p>
            <span class="card-arrow">How you work <em>→</em></span>
          </a>
          <a class="card" href="lifecycle/index.html">
            <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.64-6.36"/><polyline points="21 3 21 8 16 8"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="card-kicker">The lifecycle</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Get a model, fine-tune, build, serve</h3>
            <p class="card-desc">The four stages, one at a time, each ending with something working.</p>
            <span class="card-arrow">The lifecycle <em>→</em></span>
          </a>
          <a class="card" href="reference/thinkube-yaml.html">
            <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 4H20v14H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 4 19.5z"/><line x1="8" y1="8" x2="16" y2="8"/><line x1="8" y1="11.5" x2="13" y2="11.5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="card-kicker">Reference</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Look it up</h3>
            <p class="card-desc"><code>thinkube.yaml</code>, thinkube-control, templates, components.</p>
            <span class="card-arrow">Browse reference <em>→</em></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
{{> footer}}
  </body>
</html>
